              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ne ndaba malayika omu ng'ayimiridde mu njuba ng'ayogera mu ddoboozi ery'omwanguka ng'agamba ebinyonyi nti, \"Mujje mukuŋŋaane ku kijjulo kya Katonda omukulu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mulye ennyama y'emirambo gya bakabaka, abakulu b'amaggye n'abasajja ab'amaanyi, n'egy'embalaasi n'egy'abo abazeebagala, era n'egy'abantu bonna abaddu n'ab'eddembe, abeekitiibwa n'abatali baakitiibwa.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
